{"id":"b3-u02","level":"b3","order":2,"title":{"en":"Directions and transport","fr":"Directions et transports","es":"Direcciones y transporte","ar":"الاتجاهات والمواصلات"},"tip":{"en":"To ask the way, start with 'Excuse me, where is...?'. To give directions, use the command form: 'Turn left', 'Go straight ahead'.","fr":"Pour demander son chemin, commencez par « Excusez-moi, où est... ? ». Pour indiquer la route, utilisez l'impératif : « Tournez à gauche », « Allez tout droit ».","es":"Para preguntar el camino, empieza con «Perdone, ¿dónde está...?». Para indicarlo, usa el imperativo: «Gire a la izquierda», «Siga todo recto».","ar":"لسؤال عن الطريق ابدأ بـ«عذرا، أين...؟». ولشرح الطريق استعمل فعل الأمر: «انعطف يسارا»، «اذهب إلى الأمام»."},"words":36,"lessons":[{"id":"b3-u02-l1","type":"learn","order":1,"title":{"en":"left, right, straight ahead","fr":"à gauche, à droite, tout droit","es":"a la izquierda, a la derecha, todo recto","ar":"يسارا، يمينا، إلى الأمام"},"count":11},{"id":"b3-u02-l2","type":"learn","order":2,"title":{"en":"to cross, to stop, street","fr":"traverser, s'arrêter, rue","es":"cruzar, parar, calle","ar":"يعبر، يتوقف، شارع"},"count":10},{"id":"b3-u02-l3","type":"learn","order":3,"title":{"en":"traffic light, crossroads, bus","fr":"feu rouge, carrefour, bus","es":"semáforo, cruce, autobús","ar":"إشارة المرور، مفترق طرق، حافلة"},"count":11},{"id":"b3-u02-l4","type":"learn","order":4,"title":{"en":"station, taxi, ticket","fr":"gare, taxi, billet","es":"estación, taxi, billete","ar":"محطة القطار، سيارة أجرة، تذكرة"},"count":10},{"id":"b3-u02-l5","type":"learn","order":5,"title":{"en":"bike, on foot, near","fr":"vélo, à pied, près","es":"bicicleta, a pie, cerca","ar":"دراجة، سيرا على الأقدام، قريب"},"count":10},{"id":"b3-u02-l6","type":"learn","order":6,"title":{"en":"in front of, behind, next to","fr":"devant, derrière, à côté de","es":"delante de, detrás de, al lado de","ar":"أمام، خلف، بجانب"},"count":9},{"id":"b3-u02-l7","type":"learn","order":7,"titl